    "conclusions": [
      "The combined clarification prefix raised sampled accuracy by 48/360=13.33 percentage points, from 137/360 to185/360, while failing the frozen strong-gain gate.",
      "Straight answers improved61/120; full-wheel answers declined13/120; moderate answers remained120/120. Overall gain is therefore uneven and cannot support promotion.",
      "Moderate output preference remains dominant:343/360 baseline choices and295/360 explicit-target choices. The observed pattern is inconsistent with a general strategy that simply copies the held wheel, because each geometry/yaw is crossed with five independent wheels and most blocks retain the same output across all five.",
      "Current-wheel matches are72/360 and75/360. An output independent of current wheel produces one match per complete five-wheel block by design; a20% pooled match rate does not by itself identify copying or its absence.",
      "Current input may still influence some answers:11/72 baseline and8/72 explicit-target five-wheel blocks change their chosen answer, and stochastic repeat variation remains. The experiment does not exclude all held-input influence or identify the internal computation.",
      "The explicit straight improvement is asymmetric across reflected geometries:56/60 on positive-delta straight geometries versus8/60 on their negative-delta mirrors. The exact influential representation remains unidentified.",
      "All nonzero choices share the sign of the nominal formula result, but all fixtures also correlate target sign with road-heading sign. This is descriptive sign consistency, not proof of correct equation extraction.",
      "On the two x=15-informative geometries, baseline0/60 and explicit1/60 are correct;60/60 and59/60 match the x=15 shortcut. The same mostly moderate output preference predicts those answers, so these fixtures do not identify x=15 substitution as the cause.",
      "Omitting atan never changes the quantized label on this bank; trigonometric execution remains unidentified.",
      "Retain damped and the Python/24m live configuration. No native-menu followup or live race is triggered by the failed prospective gate."
    ],
